# =========================================
# C1 Operator & Security Authorization
# =========================================
# C1 operator authorization material — must never enter version control.
# configs/c1_operator/ holds signed approvals, launch instructions and time
# status records; scripts/analysis/provision_trust_store.py generates
# institutional signing keys. Neither may be committed.
